WEBVTT

00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:04.700
This is the final completion slide for Assignment 4
The page tracks

00:00:04.725 --> 00:00:08.438
ten knowledge checks and six coding exercises for a
total of sixteen

00:00:08.450 --> 00:00:14.512
required activities Before selecting Complete Module
look at the counters If

00:00:14.538 --> 00:00:18.588
anything is incomplete use the progress information
to return to the relevant

00:00:18.600 --> 00:00:22.450
slide The purpose of the tracker is to help you
verify your

00:00:22.475 --> 00:00:27.275
work before submission When your activities are
complete the page generates a

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:32.162
Canvas Assignment 4 report Review the counts and the
summary before copying

00:00:32.188 --> 00:00:36.150
it into the Canvas text-entry box Your work is
stored in the

00:00:36.175 --> 00:00:40.450
current browser That means it can persist as you
move between slides

00:00:40.688 --> 00:00:43.712
but it may not follow you to a different browser
private window

00:00:43.912 --> 00:00:49.600
or device Clearing browser storage can also remove
saved progress If

00:00:49.625 --> 00:00:53.538
you intentionally choose to submit before everything
is complete read the progress

00:00:53.562 --> 00:00:57.612
summary carefully so you know what is missing This
final step is

00:00:57.625 --> 00:01:02.438
not just administrative It is one more validation
step confirm that the

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:06.625
learning activities coding work and submission
summary all match what you intended

00:01:06.650 --> 00:01:07.288
to complete
